# CODEOWNERS — Jazan HRP Tracking Platform
#
# GitHub automatically requests reviews from the listed owners whenever a pull
# request touches the matched paths.  Branch protection is configured to
# *require* at least one code-owner approval before any PR can be merged into
# main (see setup-branch-protection.yml and CONTRIBUTING.md).
#
# Format: <path-pattern>  <owner> [<owner> …]
# Patterns follow .gitignore glob rules; LATER rules override earlier ones.
# Place broader patterns first and more specific patterns last so that specific
# rules win.
#
# To add GitHub team co-owners (e.g. @jazan-health/backend-leads), append them
# after the individual username on the relevant lines once those teams exist in
# your GitHub organisation.

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Fallback — everything not matched by a more specific rule below
